        <div class="feature-text">
            <p class="sqsrte-large">Production Coordinator</p>
            <p>Independent Short Film - Submitted to South by Southwest (SXSW)</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Collaborated on an independent short film submitted to film festival South by Southwest. Managed call sheets, organized casting, coordinated with crew, and oversaw on-set logistics. Operated production vehicles, set up LED lighting, promoted cast and crew stability, handled craft services to maintain an efficient shooting schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-image">
            <img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66a135183ddfaa43af16a576/a4687ce0-8326-4c8d-a194-8fa2de23a919/P1+STEEL+STRUCTURE.jpeg" alt="Film Production">
        </div>
    </div>
