    <div class="feature-row reverse">
        <div class="feature-text">
            <p class="sqsrte-large">Assistant Director</p>
            <p>AUSOC - Tenleytown, D.C. | January 2025 - March 2025</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">Researched and contacted vendors, venues, and contacts to enhance client experiences and events. Managed and oversaw efforts between company and event volunteers, both before, during, and after live events. Maintained databases, supplies ordering, organization, and managing incoming and outgoing deliveries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-image">
            <img src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66a135183ddfaa43af16a576/19b69576-c8d1-49ee-b675-4a3dba77efca/mom.jpg" alt="AUSOC">
